<metadata><name>Day 45 - Pretty River, Russ McConnell, Pretty River Access</name></metadata>
<wpt lat="44.430927" lon="-80.275390"><name>P Start/finish parking</name><desc>Parking area located 380 m north of the main Trail crossing on Pretty River Rd. Free</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.429367" lon="-80.279415"><name>J1</name><desc>J1: Continue straight onto the white-blazed main Bruce Trail, heading south. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off ahead.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.428954" lon="-80.288102"><name>J2</name><desc>J2: Turn sharp right onto the blue-blazed Pretty River Side Trail, heading north. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off on your left.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.432904" lon="-80.296510"><name>J3</name><desc>J3: Continue straight onto the white-blazed main Bruce Trail, heading north-west. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off on your left.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.437311" lon="-80.297249"><name>J4</name><desc>J4: Junction. Continue straight to stay on the main Bruce Trail, heading north. (the blue-blazed John Haigh Side Trail goes off on your left.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.438638" lon="-80.292081"><name>J5</name><desc>J5: Turn left onto the blue-blazed Russ McConnell Side Trail, heading north-west. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off ahead.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.445285" lon="-80.289625"><name>J6</name><desc>J6: End of the Russ McConnell Side Trail. Turn around and retrace your steps.</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
